<title>JAPAN: Mitsui Petrochemical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mitsui Petrochemical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		153.85		vs	  159.83</p>
<p> Operating	    7.77		vs	    9.54</p>
<p> Current		7.65		vs	    8.50</p>
<p> Net		    5.31		vs	    5.36</p>
<p> EPS		   17.04 yen	  vs	   17.20 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    312 million	  vs	 312 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsui Petrochemical Industries Ltd belongs to the Mitsui group and is a leading maker of synthetic textile materials.</p>
